# This directory is bind-mounted into WildFly as standalone/deployments.
#
# Maven writes enrollment.war here (see <outputDirectory> in pom.xml) and
# WildFly's deployment scanner picks it up automatically.
#
# Git does not track empty directories, so this placeholder file exists purely
# to make sure the folder is present after a fresh clone. Without it, the bind
# mount would create it as a root-owned directory and WildFly could not write
# its marker files. The convention is called a ".gitkeep file".
#
# Everything else in here is build output and is excluded by .gitignore.
